# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify routing for porikkhangon.app
#
# The question pages and the sitemap are rendered dynamically by the backend
# (seo/ssr-server.mjs) so that ALL 50k+ questions in the database have a real
# 200-OK page without a rebuild. Everything else is served from dist/.
#
# Real files in dist/ always win over these rules, so /seo.css and any
# statically generated /q/<slug>/ page still take precedence.

/q/*                     https://mongodb-hb6b.onrender.com/q/:splat      200
/sitemap.xml             https://mongodb-hb6b.onrender.com/sitemap.xml   200
/sitemap-questions-*.xml https://mongodb-hb6b.onrender.com/:splat        200

# SPA fallback (hash router lives in index.html)
/*  /index.html  200
